SOAPBOX: This was a very nice event. Thanks to everyone who participated
SOAPBOX: and to those who made this possible. I found myself traveling
SOAPBOX: Friday and Saturday, so I wasn't on the contest. Later I spent
SOAPBOX: some time making some contacts, and found it totally enjoyable.
SOAPBOX: For me this was a part time effort, with a wire dipole antenna.
SOAPBOX: I particularly enjoyed the last hour on 80 meters. This is a
SOAPBOX: great hobby! Again, thanks to all those who operated and those
SOAPBOX: who made the contest possible.
